  "bug_fixed": "A Rust caller catching a panic before commit memory application could continue with an unpoisoned coordinator. Later staging cleanup and GC pruned an accepted task absent from memory and reclaimed its input. Quarantine is now armed before callbacks/apply and cleared only after successful application.",
